#This is a local file referencing an antiSMASH database directory installed
#by the "Download antiSMASH databases" data manager. In CI the antiSMASH
#tool tests are commented out, so this file's path is only relevant for
#local testing of the tool (point it at your locally installed database).
#
#file has this format (white space characters are TAB characters)
#
#The columns are:
#value	name	path	version
#
#For example
antismash_databases_8.0.4	antiSMASH databases 8.0.4	/data/antismash_databases/antismash_databases_8.0.4	8.0.4